 "message": "Hi Chloe, here's where each item stands:\n\n1. Yusuf Demir (E024), offboarding: started (OFF-1001). Yusuf's last day is Friday 18 December 2026, and all his access will be removed at 17:00 local that day. His laptop and badge need to be returned within 5 business days after the last day, and IT will email a prepaid return label. This follows POL-OFF-01. His contract end date in the directory is 31 December 2026, so if the last day should be a different date, let me know and I can restart it with the right one.\n\n2. Yusuf's BI access: I haven't filed this, and it can't be granted. BI is for full-time employees only, and contractors are never eligible for elevated or restricted systems (POL-ACC-02). For his handover reports, you may want to ask the BI owner or a full-time colleague to pull the data or build the reports with him. I can't make exceptions. Any exception would need the department head to email Security directly.\n\n3. Kevin Walsh (E040), CRM: access request REQ-1002 is filed and routed to you as his manager for approval (standard systems, POL-ACC-01). Access is not granted until you sign off.\n\nNote that you're the approver for Kevin's request, so you'll need to approve it yourself when you're back, or it may need another route while you're out.",
